WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Text is a string
Quotation marks surround a string. Use a variable to keep a message and print it whenever you need it.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Change the case
The upper() method returns an uppercase version of a string. It does not change the original string.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Insert a value into text
Start a string with f to make an f-string. Expressions inside braces are evaluated and inserted into the text.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Ready to practice?
Exercise 1 checks upper() and f-strings. A regular string without the f prefix keeps the braces as ordinary text.
